@startuml
' Frontier exploration class diagram for current Hiwonder/Nav2 stack
' 주의: 초기 프로토타입(ExplorerNode/HazardMapNode) 기준 다이어그램.
' 두 클래스 다 commit eb9eaab 에서 삭제됨 — 지금은 frontier_exploration_ros2
' + state_manager/mission_executor/vision_detector/fire_keepout_node 로 대체됨.

skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif

title UNCC Frontier 기반 자율 탐사 클래스 구조\n(Hiwonder + SLAM Toolbox + Nav2 + Hazard Map)

package "기존 Hiwonder / Nav2" {

  class SlamToolbox <<ROS2 Node>> {
    +publishMap() : /map
    +publishMapToOdomTF()
  }

  class GlobalCostmap <<Nav2 Costmap>> {
    +globalFrame : map
    +resolution : 0.05
    +updateFrequency : 1.0
    +staticLayer
    +obstacleLayer(/scan_raw)
    +inflationLayer
  }

  class LocalCostmap <<Nav2 Costmap>> {
    +globalFrame : odom
    +rollingWindow : true
    +width : 3.0
    +height : 3.0
    +resolution : 0.03
    +voxelLayer(/scan_raw)
    +inflationLayer
  }

  class PlannerServer <<Nav2>> {
    +computePathToPose()
  }

  class BtNavigator <<Nav2>> {
    +navigateToPose()
    +cancelGoal()
  }

  class ControllerServer <<Nav2>> {
    +followPath()
    +publishCmdVelNav()
  }

  class VelocitySmoother <<Nav2>> {
    +smoothVelocity()
    +publishCmdVel()
  }

  class RobotController <<Hiwonder>> {
    +subscribe(/cmd_vel)
    +publish(/odom_raw)
  }
}

package "uncc_example - 새로 구현" {

  class ExplorerNode <<ROS2 Node>> {
    -currentMap : MapData
    -globalCostmap : CostmapData
    -localCostmap : CostmapData
    -hazardMap : HazardMapData
    -robotPose : Pose2D
    -frontiers : List<Frontier>
    -currentGoal : Frontier
    +mapCallback()
    +globalCostmapCallback()
    +localCostmapCallback()
    +hazardMapCallback()
    +updateRobotPoseFromTF()
    +exploreOnce()
    +filterCandidates()
    +selectBestFrontier()
    +handleNavigationResult()
    +requestReplan()
  }

  class FrontierDetector {
    +detectFrontierCells(map) : List<Cell>
    +clusterFrontiers(cells) : List<Frontier>
    +calculateCentroid(cluster) : Pose2D
    +chooseSafeGoal(cluster, map) : Pose2D
    +calculateInformationGain(frontier, map) : double
  }

  class PriorityCalculator {
    -wInfoGain : double
    -wMission : double
    -wPath : double
    -wHazard : double
    -wGlobalCost : double
    -wNarrowness : double
    -wFailure : double
    +calculateGlobalCost(frontier, globalCostmap) : double
    +calculateNarrowness(frontier, globalCostmap) : double
    +calculateHazardRisk(frontier, hazardMap) : double
    +calculateMissionValue(frontier, hazardMap) : double
    +calculateScore(frontier) : double
  }

  class Nav2Navigator {
    -computePathClient
    -navigateToPoseClient
    +isReachable(goal) : bool
    +calculatePathCost(goal) : double
    +sendGoal(goal)
    +cancelGoal()
    +isNavigating() : bool
  }

  class HazardMapNode <<ROS2 Node>> {
    -hazardMap : HazardMapData
    +perceptionCallback()
    +projectDetectionToMap()
    +applySpatialSpread()
    +applyTemporalDecay()
    +publishHazardMap() : /hazard_map
  }

  class SafetyMonitor {
    -localCostmap : CostmapData
    -hazardMap : HazardMapData
    +isImmediatePathBlocked() : bool
    +isLocalHazardTooHigh() : bool
    +shouldCancelGoal() : bool
  }

  class MapData <<Data>> {
    +resolution : double
    +width : int
    +height : int
    +originX : double
    +originY : double
    +occupancyData[] : int8
    +worldToCell(x, y)
    +cellToWorld(i, j)
    +getCell(i, j)
    +isFree(i, j) : bool
    +isUnknown(i, j) : bool
  }

  class CostmapData <<Data>> {
    +resolution : double
    +width : int
    +height : int
    +originX : double
    +originY : double
    +costData[]
    +getCostWorld(x, y) : int
    +isLethal(x, y) : bool
    +isInflated(x, y) : bool
  }

  class HazardMapData <<Data>> {
    +resolution : double
    +width : int
    +height : int
    +riskData[] : float
    +missionValueData[] : float
    +getRisk(x, y) : double
    +getMissionValue(x, y) : double
  }

  class Pose2D <<Data>> {
    +x : double
    +y : double
    +yaw : double
  }

  class Frontier <<Data>> {
    +cells : List<Cell>
    +goalPose : Pose2D
    +informationGain : double
    +missionValue : double
    +navigationCost : double
    +globalCost : double
    +hazardRisk : double
    +narrowness : double
    +failurePenalty : double
    +score : double
    +failureCount : int
  }

  class PerceptionInfo <<Data>> {
    +fireConfidence : double
    +personDetected : bool
    +obstacleInfo
    +hazardClass
    +positionInMap : Pose2D
  }
}

note right of PriorityCalculator
권장 점수식

Score =
  + wI * InformationGain
  + wM * MissionValue
  - wP * PathCost
  - wH * HazardRisk
  - wG * GlobalCost
  - wN * Narrowness
  - wF * FailurePenalty

화재 탐사 로봇에서는
"fireHint"를 MissionValue로,
실제 접근 위험은 HazardRisk로
분리하는 것이 좋음.
end note

note bottom of FrontierDetector
Frontier 검출 기준:
현재 /map에서 FREE 셀이
UNKNOWN 셀과 인접하면 frontier.

Frontier 생성 자체는 SLAM /map 사용.
Global Costmap은 후보 검증/점수화에 사용.
end note

note bottom of HazardMapNode
1차 구현:
Hazard Map을 Nav2 costmap과 분리하고
Frontier 점수 + 목표 취소 판단에 사용.

2차 구현:
Nav2 custom Costmap Layer 또는
Keepout/Costmap Filter로 hazard를
경로 계획에 직접 반영 가능.
end note

' Existing data flow
SlamToolbox --> ExplorerNode : /map\nnav_msgs/OccupancyGrid
SlamToolbox --> GlobalCostmap : live /map
GlobalCostmap --> ExplorerNode : /global_costmap/costmap(_raw)
LocalCostmap --> ExplorerNode : /local_costmap/costmap(_raw)

' Ownership / collaboration
ExplorerNode *-- FrontierDetector
ExplorerNode *-- PriorityCalculator
ExplorerNode *-- Nav2Navigator
ExplorerNode *-- SafetyMonitor
ExplorerNode o-- MapData
ExplorerNode o-- CostmapData
ExplorerNode o-- HazardMapData
ExplorerNode o-- Frontier
ExplorerNode o-- Pose2D

HazardMapNode *-- HazardMapData
HazardMapNode --> ExplorerNode : /hazard_map
PerceptionInfo --> HazardMapNode : perception result

FrontierDetector --> MapData
FrontierDetector --> Frontier
PriorityCalculator --> Frontier
PriorityCalculator --> CostmapData
PriorityCalculator --> HazardMapData
SafetyMonitor --> CostmapData
SafetyMonitor --> HazardMapData

Nav2Navigator --> PlannerServer : ComputePathToPose
Nav2Navigator --> BtNavigator : NavigateToPose
BtNavigator --> ControllerServer
ControllerServer --> VelocitySmoother : /cmd_vel_nav
VelocitySmoother --> RobotController : /cmd_vel

' Sensor based costmaps
RobotController ..> LocalCostmap : motion + /scan_raw/TF
RobotController ..> GlobalCostmap : motion + /scan_raw/TF

' Optional future integration
HazardMapNode ..> GlobalCostmap : <<v2 custom hazard layer>>
HazardMapNode ..> LocalCostmap : <<v2 custom hazard layer>>

@enduml
